 "description": "Build: three K3s server Incus containers with embedded etcd, only through typed Host Agent calls. Host A provisions e2e-k1 (clusterInit) and checks prepare-ha; host B provisions e2e-k2 and e2e-k3, and each joins through prepare-join on A (join material sealed to B's receiver key), redeem-join on B (unsealed by B's provider) and join-node on B. The goal's prepare-ha and ensure-ha-endpoint before provisioning are refused (unknown cluster target); ensure-ha-endpoint against the built cluster is recorded. Pass: 3 Ready servers, 3 etcd members, and the join token in no record, row or log.",
